  "id": "section-846",
  "title": "在第七次接见红卫兵大会上与中央负责同志的谈话",
  "level": 0,
  "sourceUrl": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-226.htm",
  "html": "<table><tbody><tr><td> -&gt;  -&gt; <a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">1968年汉版《毛泽东思想万岁》</a><hr>\n<b>226)</b>\n\n\n<br>\n<br>\n　　你们要政治挂帅，到群众里面去，和群众在一起，把无产阶级文化大革命搞得更好。<br><br><hr><p><a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-225.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">上一页</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">目录</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-227.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">下一页</a><br><br></p></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n"
